---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for MegaTools Hub">
	<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
		<div class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert">
			<p>Last updated: [INSERT_DATE_HERE]</p>
			<h2>1. Data Processing</h2>
			<p>Most of the tools provided on MegaTools Hub operate entirely client-side. This means that the data you input (e.g., text, code, IP addresses, JWTs) is processed directly by your web browser and is never transmitted to our servers.</p>
			
			<h2>2. External Services</h2>
			<p>Some specific tools (like DNS Lookups or External API testing) may require server-side requests. We do not log or store the queries made through these specific tools.</p>
			
			<h2>3. Third-Party Analytics and Advertising</h2>
			<p>We may use third-party services (such as [INSERT_ANALYTICS_PROVIDER] and Google AdSense) that use cookies to collect anonymous usage data and serve relevant advertisements. You can manage your cookie preferences in your browser settings.</p>

            <h2>4. Contact</h2>
            <p>If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us at [INSERT_EMAIL_HERE].</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
